<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 01:28:14 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>极其基础的人工智能提示破解了数十年的数学难题</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/extremely-basic-ai-prompt-cracks-decadesold-maths-problem</link><description>一周内第二次，一个长期存在的猜想被人工智能反驳，凸显了 ChatGPT 及其同类产品的先进数学能力&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/extremely-basic-ai-prompt-cracks-decadesold-maths-problem2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 01:28:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/extremely-basic-ai-prompt-cracks-decadesold-maths-problem</guid></item><item><title>蛋白质过量提示细胞健康的平衡</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/protein-excess-tips-the-balance-of-cellular-health</link><description>为了使细胞正常运作，它们必须产生适量的每种蛋白质。这是一种微妙的平衡：太少和太多都会损害基本的细胞功能。一个研究小组现在表明，即使是适度过量的微管蛋白（组装成微管的蛋白质，细胞的内部支架）也足以破坏组织结构并降低细胞活力。发表于&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/protein-excess-tips-the-balance-of-cellular-health.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 01:13:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/protein-excess-tips-the-balance-of-cellular-health</guid></item><item><title>3D 多组学肿瘤图谱：从技术到生物学和临床转化</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/3d-multiomics-tumour-atlases-from-technology-to-biology-and-clinical-translation-reviews-cancer</link><description>在这篇评论中，刘&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/3d-multiomics-tumour-atlases-from-technology-to-biology-and-clinical-translation-reviews-cancer2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 00:58:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/3d-multiomics-tumour-atlases-from-technology-to-biology-and-clinical-translation-reviews-cancer</guid></item><item><title>令人震惊的新研究在大多数心脏病患者的血液中检测到微塑料</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/microplastics-detected-in-most-heart-attack-patients-blood-in-startling-new-study</link><description>新研究发现，与心脏病稳定的人相比，大多数心脏病发作患者血液中的微塑料和纳米塑料浓度明显更高。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/microplastics-detected-in-most-heart-attack-patients-blood-in-startling-new-study.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 00:43:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/microplastics-detected-in-most-heart-attack-patients-blood-in-startling-new-study</guid></item><item><title>旋转超材料单元可以实现超出传统限制的远程波控制</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/rotating-metamaterial-units-could-enable-long-range-wave-control-beyond-conventional-limits</link><description>由机械工程系 Joo Hwan Oh 教授领导的首尔国立大学工程学院研究小组与韩国标准与科学研究所 (KRISS) 的 Myung Hwan Bae 博士合作，开发了一种新型弹性超材料平台，可以自由设计外部施加的力和振动如何传播。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/rotating-metamaterial-units-could-enable-long-range-wave-control-beyond-conventional-limits2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 00:28:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/rotating-metamaterial-units-could-enable-long-range-wave-control-beyond-conventional-limits</guid></item><item><title>蝴蝶胶质瘤：活检或消融队列研究</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/butterfly-gliomas-to-biopsy-or-to-ablate-cohort-study-neurooncology</link><description>蝴蝶神经胶质瘤是高级神经胶质瘤的一种侵袭性亚型，其特征是双侧半球受累。这些患者通常只接受活检，然后进行放化疗，而不是手术切除。激光间质热疗 (LITT) 提供了一种可以提高生存率的微创替代方案。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/butterfly-gliomas-to-biopsy-or-to-ablate-cohort-study-neurooncology.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 00:13:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/butterfly-gliomas-to-biopsy-or-to-ablate-cohort-study-neurooncology</guid></item><item><title>太空部队希望为卫星通信实验提供商业带宽</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/space-force-wants-commercial-bandwidth-for-satcom-experiments</link><description>太空部队正在计划进行一系列实验，以测试将其窄带卫星通信任务扩展到中地轨道的概念。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/space-force-wants-commercial-bandwidth-for-satcom-experiments.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 23:58:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/space-force-wants-commercial-bandwidth-for-satcom-experiments</guid></item><item><title>超越人类直觉的算法设计光子电路</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/algorithmdesigned-photonic-circuits-beyond-human-intuition</link><description>逆向设计可实现紧凑、可代工的氮化硅光子元件&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/algorithmdesigned-photonic-circuits-beyond-human-intuition.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 23:43:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/algorithmdesigned-photonic-circuits-beyond-human-intuition</guid></item><item><title>CRISPR-Cas编排分层防御网络来对抗细菌病毒</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/crispr-cas-orchestrates-a-layered-defense-network-to-fight-bacterial-viruses</link><description>所有细胞生命——从人类到细菌——都拥有两层免疫：先天免疫和适应性免疫。科学家们很早就了解这两种类型的免疫如何在高等生物体中协同作用，但在微生物世界中却不清楚。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/crispr-cas-orchestrates-a-layered-defense-network-to-fight-bacterial-viruses.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 23:28:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/crispr-cas-orchestrates-a-layered-defense-network-to-fight-bacterial-viruses</guid></item><item><title>逆转年龄干细胞治疗在人体试验中取得成功田边浩二博士</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/age-reversing-stem-cell-treatment-succeeds-in-human-trial-dr-koji-tanabe</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 23:13:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/age-reversing-stem-cell-treatment-succeeds-in-human-trial-dr-koji-tanabe</guid></item></channel></rss>